    ["5230055   流程图测试   位面"] = "5230055 Flowchart Test Plane",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Connections</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>\nWith the help of the Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Corridor of History</>, you can search for figures scattered throughout history within the gaps of time, get to know them, and borrow power from the past.\nGetting to know them multiple times increases your understanding of the target and grants you access to more authentic and powerful abilities.\n1. You can obtain <Assistant_Property1>Connections</> by <Assistant_Property2>making acquaintances</>, which unlocks corresponding skills.\n2. Duplicate Connections can be used to upgrade your Connection level, thereby enhancing the effects of the corresponding skills.\n3. Making more acquaintances increases your understanding of them, improves your {SendAnswer:关系|551}Historical Research<Assistant_Property2> level, and grants certain attribute bonuses.</>\nHow to make acquaintances:<Assistant_Title2></>Click \nMenu - Connections - Make Acquaintances<Assistant_System> to enter the </>interface, then click 'Make Acquaintance 1 time/5 times' to proceed.{SendAnswer:结交人脉|554}\nCost:<Assistant_Title2></>Each attempt requires one \nHistorical Beacon{SendAnswer:历史明灯|556}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rules:</>\n1. In every 5 attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain at least one Epic-grade Connection or higher.\n2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection after 24 consecutive attempts, the probability will gradually increase. You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 attempts. Once a Legendary Connection is obtained, the counter resets and the probability returns to the base rate.\n3. The pity counters for permanent and limited-time events are accumulated separately and do not affect each other.\n4. For permanent events, you can set a wish for a specific Connection to increase the probability of obtaining it.\n5. When you obtain a duplicate Connection, you will receive additional {SendAnswer:投影片段|557}projection fragments. If that Connection has already reached its maximum level or you have enough materials to reach the maximum, the number of fragments received will increase. Fragments can be used in the Connections Shop to exchange for Historical Beacons or specific Connections.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[关系]|551}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}, {SendAnswer:[人脉许愿]|555}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connections</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Instructions:</>\nWith the help of the Sealed Artifact <Assistant_Property1>Corridor of History</>, you can search for figures scattered throughout history within the gaps of time, get to know them, and borrow power from the past.\nGetting to know them multiple times increases your understanding of the target and grants you access to more authentic and powerful abilities.\n1. You can obtain <Assistant_Property1>Connections</> by <Assistant_Property2>making acquaintances</>, which unlocks corresponding skills.\n2. Duplicate Connections can be used to upgrade your Connection level, thereby enhancing the effects of the corresponding skills.\n3. Making more acquaintances increases your understanding of them, improves your {SendAnswer:Relationship|551}Historical Research<Assistant_Property2> level, and grants certain attribute bonuses.</>\nHow to make acquaintances:<Assistant_Title2></>Click \nMenu - Connections - Make Acquaintances<Assistant_System> to enter the </>interface, then click 'Make Acquaintance 1 time/5 times' to proceed.{SendAnswer:Befriend Connections|554}\nCost:<Assistant_Title2></>Each attempt requires one \nHistorical Beacon{SendAnswer:Historical Beacon|556}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rules:</>\n1. In every 5 attempts, you are guaranteed to obtain at least one Epic-grade Connection or higher.\n2. If you do not obtain a Legendary Connection after 24 consecutive attempts, the probability will gradually increase. You are guaranteed to obtain a Legendary Connection every 40 attempts. Once a Legendary Connection is obtained, the counter resets and the probability returns to the base rate.\n3. The pity counters for permanent and limited-time events are accumulated separately and do not affect each other.\n4. For permanent events, you can set a wish for a specific Connection to increase the probability of obtaining it.\n5. When you obtain a duplicate Connection, you will receive additional {SendAnswer:Projection Fragments|557}projection fragments. If that Connection has already reached its maximum level or you have enough materials to reach the maximum, the number of fragments received will increase. Fragments can be used in the Connections Shop to exchange for Historical Beacons or specific Connections.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Wish]|555}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>非凡物质</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n1、带有非凡力量的物质，可以填充入<Assistant_Property1>封印物</>来稳定历史投影，并解锁更多额外的<Assistant_Property2>非凡共鸣</>效果。\n2、非凡特性的力量量化为词条，不同非凡物质由于构成的非凡特性序列与数量不同，词条数量、类型与强度会有不同。最少有1条词条，最多可以达到6条词条，超过6条词条的非凡物质暂时未被发现。\n3、非凡物质的随机词条受高位格力量影响或污染，可能会出现异变，<Assistant_Property2>异变词条</>相对于普通词条，会带来更为强大的效果。异变词条在单个非凡物质上最多出现1条。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[封印物]|1265}，{SendAnswer:[获取非凡物质]|1269}，{SendAnswer:[非凡物质聚合]|1270}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Beyonder Material</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </>\n1. Materials containing Beyonder power can be filled into <Assistant_Property1>Sealed Artifacts</> to stabilize historical projections and unlock more additional <Assistant_Property2>Beyonder Resonance</> effects.\n2. The power of Beyonder characteristics is quantified into entries. Due to the different Beyonder characteristic sequences and quantities that compose them, Beyonder materials vary in the number, type, and strength of their entries. There is at least 1 entry, and up to 6 entries; Beyonder materials with more than 6 entries have not yet been discovered.\n3. The random entries of Beyonder materials are influenced or corrupted by high-level powers, which may lead to mutations. <Assistant_Property2>Mutated entries</> bring more powerful effects compared to ordinary entries. A single Beyonder material can have at most 1 mutated entry.\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Sealed Artifact]|1265}, {SendAnswer:[Obtaining Beyonder Materials]|1269}, {SendAnswer:[Beyonder Material Aggregation]|1270}",
